// Smoke eval: rebuilds the deterministic scene, captures a screenshot, and
// compares it against the golden. Fails if similarity drops below PassThreshold.
// Launch: BlockWorld.exe autotest testingmode fixedtimestep script EVALSmoke
// Requires: blockgametests\EVALGoldenShot.png (deployed by the eval runner).

number PassThreshold 95

script EVALScene

16 test_prtscn EVALCurrentShot 256 256

18 test_writeheading EVALSmoke Run
18.1 test_writestart
18.2 test_imagewithin EVALGoldenShot EVALCurrentShot PassThreshold Golden_vs_Current
18.4 test_writeend

20 exit
